Three complete anchor receipts are now durable (`SEALED w1/s0`, `w1/s1`, `w2/s0`), with `w2/s1` and `w3/s0` in progress. All 34 endpoints evaluated so far fail the 2-swap test. I’m retaining every result, including randomized starts that finish below the nearest-start reference; best-of-k will be selected only after convergence and will not hide the full spread.
